**Java Pattern - Type checking with string identity (lines 212-228):**
```java
} else if (typePrev == WHITESPACE && typeCurrent != WHITESPACE) {
} else if (typePrev == WHITESPACE && typeCurrent == WHITESPACE) {
    pass = 2;
} else if (typePrev != WHITESPACE && typeCurrent == WHITESPACE) {
