### 6.5 System.arraycopy Pattern

**Java Pattern (Entry.java:732-735):**
```java
char[] buf = new char[prevEntry.length + nextEntry.length];
System.arraycopy(prevEntry.buf, prevEntry.start, buf, 0, prevEntry.length);
System.arraycopy(nextEntry.buf, nextEntry.start, buf, prevEntry.length, nextEntry.length);
