## Risk Mitigation Strategies

### 1. Behavioral Verification
- Create golden output files from Java implementation
- Compare Kotlin outputs against golden files
- Automate comparison in CI/CD

### 2. Incremental Migration
- Use `@JvmStatic`, `@JvmField`, `@JvmOverloads` annotations
- Maintain Java-Kotlin interoperability during transition
- Convert one package at a time

### 3. Performance Monitoring
- Benchmark before and after each phase
- Monitor memory usage (char[] vs String conversions)
- Track GC behavior changes

### 4. Rollback Strategy
- Keep Java files until phase validation complete
- Use feature branches per phase
- Tag stable points

