## File Dependencies Graph

```
CharVector (Phase 2)
    |
    +-- DataInput/DataOutput (Phase 3)
    |       |
    |       +-- Dictionary classes (Phase 4)
    |               |
    |               +-- ProductNameDictionary
    |
    +-- MorphUtil (Phase 5)
